import{_ as t,o as n,c as i,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const u=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 293 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | In-Depth Analysis of Retcon / Bad Ending: Late Settings Overturn Early Ones","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 293 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | In-Depth Analysis of Retcon / Bad Ending: Late Settings Overturn Early Ones","no":293,"module":2,"tags":["Shrouding the Heavens","Retcon","Bad Ending","Settings Overturned","Law-First Axiom"],"related":["97-Setting Contradiction Self-Check Table","99-Document Version and Maintenance Notes","14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0293_模块2-遮天-吃书烂尾深度分析.md","filePath":"en/0293_模块2-遮天-吃书烂尾深度分析.md"}'),a={name:"en/0293_模块2-遮天-吃书烂尾深度分析.md"};function s(r,e,l,d,h,c){return n(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-293-shrouding-the-heavens-decomposition-in-depth-analysis-of-retcon-bad-ending-late-settings-overturn-early-ones" tabindex="-1">Entry 293 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | In-Depth Analysis of Retcon / Bad Ending: Late Settings Overturn Early Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-293-shrouding-the-heavens-decomposition-in-depth-analysis-of-retcon-bad-ending-late-settings-overturn-early-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 293 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | In-Depth Analysis of Retcon / Bad Ending: Late Settings Overturn Early Ones&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Full Decomposition of the Shrouding-the-Heavens System (Entry 6) | Benchmark base: Documents 97, 99, 14</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-holes-dug-early-filled-with-bulldozers-late" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Holes dug early, filled with bulldozers late <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-holes-dug-early-filled-with-bulldozers-late" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Holes dug early, filled with bulldozers late&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the law-first axiom requires &quot;never retcon, never end badly.&quot; This entry specifically discusses how Shrouding-the-Heavens as a long-serialized IP late-stage constantly overturns early iron laws — this is not an author-ability problem, but the inevitable ending of the &quot;setting serves plot&quot; structure. Protagonist uniqueness dependency = medium (oligarchic civilization). The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s evaluation base has been upgraded to six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Retconning itself is the biggest narrative energy waste:</p><ul><li>Early chapters spent establishing some iron law late overturned, equivalent to those chapters&#39; narrative investment zeroing out</li><li>The author repeatedly &quot;explains&quot; why early settings do not count; the text is full of self-defense</li><li>Old readers&#39; nostalgia is repeatedly consumed, emotional trust overdrawn in repeated reversals</li></ul><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>&quot;Regression&quot; retconning creates inside the world-view:</p><ol><li><strong>History rewritten</strong>: some early emperor&#39;s glorious combat record late shrinks due to new settings appearing</li><li><strong>Karma chain broken</strong>: early foreshadowing cannot be paid off, becomes hanging &quot;setting ghosts&quot;</li><li><strong>Era sense confused</strong>: after Shrouding the Heavens, Perfect World, Shrouding the Void trilogy linkage, character identities, era order repeatedly adjusted; readers cannot build a clear timeline</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Behind retconning is the author&#39;s predation on setting assets:</p><ul><li><strong>&quot;The protagonist needs&quot; above all</strong>: as long as Ye Fan needs to cross tiers, early iron laws step aside — this is open predation on early world settings</li><li><strong>Foreshadowing becomes debt</strong>: early carefully buried suspense late is written off with &quot;actually it&#39;s not what you think,&quot; equivalent to reneging</li><li><strong>Cross-work repeated retconning</strong>: trilogy linkage, same character&#39;s settings drift across works, repeatedly squeezing readers&#39; cross-work nostalgia</li></ul><p>Retconning also has an often-overlooked cost: it punishes careful readers. Those who chase chapter by chapter, carefully record foreshadowing, try to rebuild the world-view in their heads, are the most invested, most emotionally attached audience. Each retcon is a betrayal of these most loyal readers. Shrouding-the-Heavens&#39; late retconning does not harm casual readers, but those old book fans who followed Ye Fan from Sea of Wheels all the way to Red-Dust Immortal. Heng Yuan Zhou writing setting self-consistency into the top-level axiom is essentially a solemn promise to reader trust — you read carefully, I write carefully, never disown the account.</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Shrouding-Style Retconning</th><th>Heng Yuan Zhou Law-First</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Early iron laws overturned late</td><td>Law-anchored, old settings never overturned</td></tr><tr><td>Foreshadowing hanging and bad-ending</td><td>Setting Contradiction Self-Check Table periodic audit</td></tr><tr><td>Cross-work setting drift</td><td>Document Version and Maintenance Notes unified standard</td></tr><tr><td>New content overturns old</td><td>New dimensions interface as appendix incrementally</td></tr><tr><td>Plot need &gt; setting</td><td>Setting self-consistency &gt; plot convenience</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: list item by item Shrouding-the-Heavens&#39; early iron laws and late corresponding treatment</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: count &quot;overturned early setting entries&quot; and &quot;reader-trust decay curve&quot;</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: which stage retcon events concentrate in, what kind of plot needs drive them</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: conclusion — retconning highly concentrates at &quot;protagonist needs cross-tier / reversal&quot; nodes, validating the &quot;plot kidnaps setting&quot; hypothesis</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: low</strong>. After trilogy linkage, settings fight each other; timeline and character relationships in many places irreconcilable</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: extremely high</strong>. Shrouding the Heavens itself is already a risk case; overlaid with Perfect, Shrouding-the-Void linkage, risk spills over</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: medium</strong>. Retconning mainly serves Ye Fan (and series protagonists) continued narration</li></ul><p>Retconning also has a chain reaction: it makes the author late-stage increasingly afraid to write new settings, because new settings will sooner or later be overturned. So late narration increasingly relies on rearranging known elements rather than true world-view expansion. Shrouding-the-Heavens&#39; late &quot;freshness&quot; drop is largely not the author running out of talent, but retconning binding his own hands and feet — he dare not establish new settings, fearing new settings will also be overturned by future plot. The law-first axiom&#39;s freedom to the author is precisely the opposite: because rules are first set and cannot be overturned, the author dares to expand boldly, knowing newly written things will not be slapped by his own future.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: early narrative investment zeroed out, explanation cost skyrockets</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: predating early setting assets and reader trust</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo shows no obvious retconning; Shrouding-the-Heavens&#39; retconning is a disaster area among Myriad-Realms IPs</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: retconned settings often involve supporting characters, foreign races, ancient history — the marginalized&#39;s history is sacrificed first</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: cross-work linkage itself requires high self-consistency; Shrouding-the-Heavens&#39; linkage is precisely the negative example</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Retconning is not Shrouding-the-Heavens alone&#39;s disease, but the &quot;setting serves plot&quot; writing style&#39;s genetic disease. Heng Yuan Zhou writing laws before plot is precisely rooting out retconning from the base.</p><p>The opposite of retconning is not &quot;never make a mistake,&quot; but &quot;when a mistake occurs it can be fixed.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou has version maintenance notes and a setting-contradiction self-check table; when wrong, register, revise, inform readers; Shrouding-the-Heavens&#39; approach is to pretend it never erred. The former is honest, the latter is lucky.</p><p>In the final analysis, Shrouding-the-Heavens · in-depth retcon-ending analysis described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./292_模块2-遮天-境界膨胀批判.html">Entry 292 · Realm Inflation</a> · <a href="./315_模块2-遮天-完美世界联动.html">Entry 315 · Perfect World Linkage</a> · <a href="./316_模块2-遮天-圣墟联动.html">Entry 316 · Shrouding-the-Void Linkage</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/97-设定矛盾自查表.html">97-Setting Contradiction Self-Check Table</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',30)])])}const p=t(a,[["render",s]]);export{u as __pageData,p as default};
